                            "Useful message chunks: “On my way!” “Are we still on for…?” “Can we move it to…?” “Sorry, something came up.”",
                            "Emoji-free writing still matters: punctuation carries tone. “Fine.” sounds angry; “Fine :)” sounds fine."], examples: [
