                                PracticeQuestion(prompt: "Describe an app you like. (app which…)", expected: ["It's an app which helps me study.", "It's an app that tracks my habits."], focus: "which/that", watch: "Things take which or that — both are fine here."),
                                PracticeQuestion(prompt: "Talk about the place you grew up. (where)", expected: ["The town where I grew up is small.", "I grew up in a village where everyone knew everyone."], focus: "where", watch: "where replaces “in which”: “the town where I grew up”."),
                                PracticeQuestion(prompt: "Join: “The train was late. We caught it.”", expected: ["The train (that) we caught was late."], focus: "dropping that", watch: "When the joiner is the object, that can disappear."),
